# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# jkbmsr-docs (documentation site) — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored — never commit it; back it
# up somewhere safe. `.env.example` (this file) IS committed.
#
# Building the docs needs no secrets. These are for a manual
# `wrangler pages deploy` of the jkbmsr-docs Pages project — the custom-domain
# origin for docs.jkbmsr.com, which is retired as a browsable copy and 301s to
# jkbmsr.com/docs/. See DEPLOY.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Cloudflare token to deploy the Pages project.
# Needs: Account > Cloudflare Pages:Edit.
# PROD HOME: the manual deploy environment — there is no CI in this repository.
# ROLL AT:   https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
